  "title": "Sailboat race with shared wind shadows",
  "rules": [
    "Touch the assigned buoy, then your own dock. Arrival is permanent.",
    "A raised sail blocks wind for boats up to two cells downwind and one cell sideways. A shadowed raised sail cannot move.",
    "Lowered sails row one cell for one stamina. Holding recovers one stamina, capped at four.",
    "Unshadowed raised sails move one cell, or two directly downwind when strength is two.",
    "A high-sail helper can attach to an adjacent low-sail consenting boat. Towing caps speed at one cell and costs the helper one stamina.",
    "Boats cannot enter occupied cells or islands; competing moves to one cell cancel. Tow recipients follow into the helper old cell.",
    "The first arrival earns a shared-if-simultaneous half-point bonus. Waiting before arrival costs 0.01 per step.",
    "Wind changes every six transitions. Other boats and tow links obey the role-local visibility mask."
  ],
